# A roll of explosions and lasers on the 2-voice kick track, faster than they ring: every third hit steals a voice,
# which must fade out in a few milliseconds so the new hit starts at once.
tempo 120
steps 8
tail 1.5
track kick
param p1 128 0
param p2 100 0
note 0 Eb5 0.25 127
note 0.5 Db5 0.25 127
note 1 Eb5 0.25 127
note 1.5 Db5 0.25 127
note 2 Eb5 0.25 127
note 2.5 F3 0.25 127
note 3 Eb5 0.25 127
note 3.25 F3 0.25 127
note 3.5 Eb5 0.25 127
note 3.75 F3 0.25 127
expect sound 0 8
expect idle 12
expect peak_below -5
